00:11:13.523 --> 00:11:14.731
- No, we didn't know we were there.

00:11:14.731 --> 00:11:15.564
- Yeah.

00:11:15.564 --> 00:11:18.120
- It was a railway station in rush hour

00:11:18.120 --> 00:11:21.210
