00:12:45.870 --> 00:12:46.740
- Gold Diggers in 1930.

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:47.770
- Gold Diggers, yeah.

00:12:47.770 --> 00:12:48.603
- Yeah, great.

00:12:48.603 --> 00:12:49.830
- Yeah, when you send
Grave Digger a minute ago,

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:51.030
my brain said Gold Digger.

00:12:51.030 --> 00:12:53.280
And I was like, "You were a what?"

00:12:53.280 --> 00:12:54.113
- Gold Diggers.
- Literally,

00:12:54.113 --> 00:12:54.946
that's where my brain went.

00:12:54.946 --> 00:12:56.640
I was like, "I mean, you're owning it.

00:12:56.640 --> 00:12:57.473
Okay."

00:12:57.473 --> 00:13:00.176
