00:13:00.176 --> 00:13:02.190
But anyway, you said Grave Digger.

00:13:02.190 --> 00:13:03.300
I heard this crazy story.

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:04.410
I don't know if it's true,

00:13:04.410 --> 00:13:05.430
but it's about.

00:13:05.430 --> 00:13:06.333
Yes, with you.

00:13:07.170 --> 00:13:08.100
With Sir Rod.

00:13:08.100 --> 00:13:10.650
So the first time you
saw The Rolling Stones,

00:13:10.650 --> 00:13:12.870
