music at like a little,

00:13:12.870 --> 00:13:13.860
was it like a pub or theater?

00:13:13.860 --> 00:13:14.693
What was it?

00:13:14.693 --> 00:13:16.980
- Oh, it was a place
called, Eel Pie Island.

00:13:16.980 --> 00:13:18.570
It was a little ballroom in Twickenham

00:13:18.570 --> 00:13:20.910
and there was 12 people there.

00:13:20.910 --> 00:13:21.743
- 12 people.

00:13:21.743 --> 00:13:24.300
- 12 people, and mixed girlfriend.

00:13:24.300 --> 00:13:26.310
It was a girl called Chrissy Shrimpton,

00:13:26.310 --> 00:13:29.010
who's the sister of the
great model, Jean Shrimpton.

00:13:29.010 --> 00:13:32.400
And my girlfriend, his
girlfriend were friends

00:13:32.400 --> 00:13:34.615
and he said, "Come and see
my singer and my boyfriend.

00:13:34.615 --> 00:13:35.448
He's a singer."

00:13:35.448 --> 00:13:37.080
She said, "Oh, my
boyfriend's a singer too."

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:38.460
So I went over there and watched him.

00:13:38.460 --> 00:13:40.020
There was literally nobody there.

00:13:40.020 --> 00:13:43.380
And they were all sitting
on stools playing, you know.

00:13:43.380 --> 00:13:44.790
- But they were doing like blues music?

00:13:44.790 --> 00:13:46.350
- Yeah, oh, yeah.
- Yeah.

00:13:46.350 --> 00:13:48.117
- Brian Jones was in the band then.

00:13:48.117 --> 00:13:51.960
And then within six months
to a year, bash, that was it.

00:13:51.960 --> 00:13:53.190
They took off.

00:13:53.190 --> 00:13:54.850
- I mean, yeah, those
moments are just so cool.

00:13:54.850 --> 00:13:56.040
- Yeah.
- Like once again,

00:13:56.040 --> 00:13:57.510
like you busking and people not knowing

00:13:57.510 --> 00:13:58.983
and then you sitting
there and not knowing like

00:13:58.983 --> 00:14:00.378
what that band would become.
- Yeah.

00:14:00.378 --> 00:14:01.211
- Yeah, it's incredible.

00:14:01.211 --> 00:14:02.940
- I think the blues in
Britain was a big thing.

00:14:02.940 --> 00:14:04.590
So, that's where I started as well.

00:14:04.590 --> 00:14:06.150
The playing pubs playing blue stuff

00:14:06.150 --> 00:14:07.020
'cause that's what we all heard.

00:14:07.020 --> 00:14:08.092
That's it, it was a thing we,

00:14:08.092 --> 00:14:09.289
you know, that you got
people were dancing.

00:14:09.289 --> 00:14:10.410
- [Kelly] 'Cause it makes such an impact.

00:14:10.410 --> 00:14:11.400
- Yeah, yeah.
- Yeah.

00:14:11.400 --> 00:14:13.380
Like here, like there's a lot
of music you just listen to

00:14:13.380 --> 00:14:14.880
for fun, but not much that, I mean,

00:14:14.880 --> 00:14:15.789
feels like really moves you.

00:14:15.789 --> 00:14:16.622
- Yeah.

00:14:16.622 --> 00:14:17.910
- Yeah, or that's what
I like to listen to.

00:14:17.910 --> 00:14:20.749
But do you think you'll go
back to Vegas with this album?

00:14:20.749 --> 00:14:22.530
