00:14:27.736 --> 00:14:28.923
- Great.
- That's a lot of shows.

00:14:28.923 --> 00:14:29.756
- 200.

00:14:29.756 --> 00:14:30.831
- Yeah.
- And you're gonna do shows

00:14:30.831 --> 00:14:31.710
with Billy Joel as well.

00:14:31.710 --> 00:14:33.240
- Oh, we're doing a show with Billy Joel.

00:14:33.240 --> 00:14:34.920
Billy Joel asked me to join one show.

00:14:34.920 --> 00:14:36.167
- That's amazing.

00:14:36.167 --> 00:14:37.440
(audience cheering and clapping)

00:14:37.440 --> 00:14:40.792
- In September at the
Cleveland Browns stadium.

00:14:40.792 --> 00:14:41.887
- Oh, my gosh.

00:14:41.887 --> 00:14:44.310
- But yeah, I love Vegas.

00:14:44.310 --> 00:14:45.442
Love going there.

00:14:45.442 --> 00:14:46.620
- Yeah.
- The people at Caesars Palace

00:14:46.620 --> 00:14:47.804
are just wonderful.

00:14:47.804 --> 00:14:48.637
- Agreed.
- It's the best place

00:14:48.637 --> 00:14:49.830
you can see anybody.

00:14:49.830 --> 00:14:51.440
Best seats, the best sound.

00:14:51.440 --> 00:14:52.273
Everything.
- Intimate, isn't it?

00:14:52.273 --> 00:14:53.106
It's intimate.
- It is intimate.

00:14:53.106 --> 00:14:54.390
- It feels like it.
- Yeah.

00:14:54.390 --> 00:14:55.380
No, I agree.

00:14:55.380 --> 00:14:56.351
And I love--
- You played there,

00:14:56.351 --> 00:14:57.184
didn't you?

00:14:57.184 --> 00:14:59.640
- Yes, and I love going back,

00:14:59.640 --> 00:15:02.400
my favorite, like whether
you're in a stadium or an arena

00:15:02.400 --> 00:15:05.190
or whatever, my favorite is
always a more intimate like--

00:15:05.190 --> 00:15:06.690
- Yeah, yeah.
- Five or less.

00:15:06.690 --> 00:15:08.303
5,000 or less is my favorite.

00:15:08.303 --> 00:15:12.180
I know, you play 5 million,
but I play like less

00:15:12.180 --> 00:15:13.530
and I like that though.

00:15:13.530 --> 00:15:15.307
Even like in the days
when I was like doing,

00:15:15.307 --> 00:15:16.500
"Since You've Been Gone" like everywhere

00:15:16.500 --> 00:15:18.810
